, ölçeklenebilir ve yönetilebilir yazılımlar geliştirin."}', '2026-09-09 19:10:07.508', 'cmts0wj9r0000tqzz9audivoc');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtucwcvw002qtqf3fnekgwsu', 'cmtpkwkq0002ftq54d9ou1g6y', 1, '{"blocks": [], "widget": {"limit": 4, "title": "", "layout": "grid", "source": "services", "bgImage": null, "columns": "4", "imageAlt": "", "kpiItems": [], "partType": "collection", "subtitle": "", "checklist": [], "logoItems": [{"altText": "Isra Holding", "assetId": "cmtuchyiu001mtqf3dcwmkg9m"}, {"altText": "World Press Federation", "assetId": "cmtucjx7c001qtqf33e2ysrv9"}, {"altText": "1TVTR", "assetId": "cmtucq7x1002ctqf3kvhke134"}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": "cmtucs10w002mtqf32gvjwllw"}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}], "phoneHref": "", "statLabel": "", "statValue": "", "textAlign": "start", "categories": [], "kpiVariant": "counter-grid", "phoneLabel": "", "description": "", "heroVariant": "wave", "phoneNumber": "", "titleAccent": "", "itemCtaLabel": "", "marqueeItems": [], "processItems": [], "selectionMode": "latest", "bgImageAssetId": null, "primaryCtaHref": "", "primaryCtaLabel": "", "secondaryCtaHref": "", "testimonialItems": [], "secondaryCtaLabel": "", "selectedEntityIds": []}}', '2026-09-09 17:12:28.221', 'cmts0wj9r0000tqzz9audivoc');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0kko0004tqppvrs1ng53', 'cmtui0kkk0002tqppj395qt6n', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Kapsama göre değişir: kurumsal bir web sitesi 3–4 hafta, kapsamlı bir mobil uygulama veya platform 3–6 ay sürebilir. İlk görüşmede net bir zaman planı çıkarıyor ve her sprint sonunda çalışan bir sürüm teslim ediyoruz.</p>", "question": "Bir proje genellikle ne kadar sürüyor?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.889', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0kl0000dtqppfkw0yow1', 'cmtui0kkz000btqpp6uq699qt', 1, '{"answer": "<p>İki model sunuyoruz: kapsamı net projelerde sabit fiyatlı teklif, sürekli gelişen ürünlerde ise aylık ekip modeli. Her iki modelde de ödeme kilometre taşlarına bağlıdır; sürpriz maliyet çıkmaz.</p>", "question": "Fiyatlandırma nasıl çalışıyor?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.901', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0kl8000mtqpprnqtafla', 'cmtui0kl7000ktqppyv7f71km', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Evet. Her projede 3 ay ücretsiz hata garantisi var. Sonrasında SLA’li bakım paketlerimizle sunucu takibi, güvenlik güncellemeleri ve küçük geliştirmeleri üstleniyoruz.</p>", "question": "Proje tesliminden sonra destek veriyor musunuz?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.909', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0klf000vtqppgit0pvsh', 'cmtui0kle000ttqpp9hwh7dvm', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Devralıyoruz. Önce ücretsiz bir kod denetimi yapıp mevcut durumun fotoğrafını çekiyoruz; ardından iyileştirme yol haritasıyla birlikte devir planı sunuyoruz.</p>", "question": "Mevcut bir projeyi devralabiliyor musunuz?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.915', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0kll0014tqpp0wo8olc6', 'cmtui0klk0012tqpp5cnqowqh', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Web’de React ve Node.js, mobilde React Native ve native iOS/Android, veri ve yapay zekâ tarafında Python ekosistemini kullanıyoruz. Teknolojiyi projeye göre seçiyoruz, tersini değil.</p>", "question": "Hangi teknolojilerle çalışıyorsunuz?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.921', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtui0klq001dtqppt7ujx4fq', 'cmtui0klp001btqppe94f112n', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Ücretsiz bir ön görüşmeyle başlıyoruz: ihtiyacınızı dinliyor, kapsamı birlikte netleştiriyor ve bir hafta içinde zaman planı içeren teklifimizi sunuyoruz.</p>", "question": "Süreç nasıl başlıyor?"}', '2026-09-09 19:35:42.927', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtud2s9b002wtqf3inls2p6k', 'cmtpkwkq0002ftq54d9ou1g6y', 1, '{"blocks": [], "widget": {"limit": 4, "title": "", "layout": "grid", "source": "services", "bgImage": null, "columns": "4", "imageAlt": "", "kpiItems": [], "partType": "collection", "subtitle": "", "checklist": [], "logoItems": [{"altText": "Isra Holding", "assetId": "cmtuchyiu001mtqf3dcwmkg9m"}, {"altText": "World Press Federation", "assetId": "cmtucjx7c001qtqf33e2ysrv9"}, {"altText": "1TVTR", "assetId": "cmtucq7x1002ctqf3kvhke134"}, {"altText": "Melbourne Films", "assetId": "cmtucs10w002mtqf32gvjwllw"}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}], "phoneHref": "", "statLabel": "", "statValue": "", "textAlign": "start", "categories": [], "kpiVariant": "counter-grid", "phoneLabel": "", "description": "", "heroVariant": "wave", "phoneNumber": "", "titleAccent": "", "itemCtaLabel": "", "marqueeItems": [], "processItems": [], "selectionMode": "latest", "bgImageAssetId": null, "primaryCtaHref": "", "primaryCtaLabel": "", "secondaryCtaHref": "", "testimonialItems": [], "secondaryCtaLabel": "", "selectedEntityIds": []}}', '2026-09-09 17:17:28.079', 'cmts0wj9r0000tqzz9audivoc');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf3z0003tqedpdx7bmob', 'cmtuiaf3v0001tqedl89w3kt1', 1, '{"answer": "<p>It varies depending on scope: a corporate website may take 3–4 weeks, while a comprehensive mobile application or platform can take 3–6 months. During the initial meeting, we establish a clear timeline and deliver a working version at the end of each sprint.</p>", "question": "How long does a project usually take?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.367', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf4i000rtqed379mac3h', 'cmtuiaf4h000ptqedpqfxlea7', 1, '{"answer": "<p>We offer two models: a fixed-price quote for projects with a clearly defined scope, and a monthly team model for continuously evolving products. In both models, payment is tied to milestones; there are no surprise costs.</p>", "question": "How does pricing work?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.387', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf4y001ftqedbo9lvwxe', 'cmtuiaf4x001dtqed1uik5d6d', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Yes. Every project comes with a 3-month free bug-fix guarantee. Afterwards, our SLA-based maintenance packages cover server monitoring, security updates, and minor enhancements.</p>", "question": "Do you provide support after project delivery?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.403', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf5b0023tqed9mo3poei', 'cmtuiaf5a0021tqedxdvs1kdt', 1, '{"answer": "<p>Yes, we take over existing projects. We first perform a free code audit to capture a snapshot of the current state, then present a handover plan along with an improvement roadmap.</p>", "question": "Can you take over an existing project?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.416', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtud33ha0032tqf3hcq9gx2f', 'cmtpkwkq0002ftq54d9ou1g6y', 1, '{"blocks": [], "widget": {"limit": 4, "title": "", "layout": "grid", "source": "services", "bgImage": null, "columns": "4", "imageAlt": "", "kpiItems": [], "partType": "collection", "subtitle": "", "checklist": [], "logoItems": [{"altText": "Isra Holding", "assetId": "cmtuchyiu001mtqf3dcwmkg9m"}, {"altText": "World Press Federation", "assetId": "cmtucjx7c001qtqf33e2ysrv9"}, {"altText": "1TVTR", "assetId": "cmtucq7x1002ctqf3kvhke134"}, {"altText": "Melbourne Films", "assetId": "cmtucs10w002mtqf32gvjwllw"}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}, {"altText": "Güvenilir marka", "assetId": null}], "phoneHref": "", "statLabel": "", "statValue": "", "textAlign": "start", "categories": [], "kpiVariant": "counter-grid", "phoneLabel": "", "description": "", "heroVariant": "wave", "phoneNumber": "", "titleAccent": "", "itemCtaLabel": "", "marqueeItems": [], "processItems": [], "selectionMode": "latest", "bgImageAssetId": null, "primaryCtaHref": "", "primaryCtaLabel": "", "secondaryCtaHref": "", "testimonialItems": [], "secondaryCtaLabel": "", "selectedEntityIds": []}}', '2026-09-09 17:17:42.622', 'cmts0wj9r0000tqzz9audivoc');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf5p002rtqedh7c2ufg0', 'cmtuiaf5p002ptqeduuitcg6a', 1, '{"answer": "<p>On the web we use React and Node.js, on mobile React Native along with native iOS/Android, and on the data and artificial intelligence side we use the Python ecosystem. We choose the technology based on the project, not the other way around.</p>", "question": "Which technologies do you work with?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.43', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
INSERT INTO public."ContentTranslationRevision" (id, "translationId", "schemaVersion", payload, "createdAt", "createdBy") VALUES ('cmtuiaf61003ftqedfr4ihr0g', 'cmtuiaf61003dtqedvgsczpkh', 1, '{"answer": "<p>We start with a free preliminary consultation: we listen to your needs, jointly clarify the scope, and present our proposal along with a timeline within a week.</p>", "question": "How does the process begin?"}', '2026-09-09 19:43:22.442', 'cmtuhhwl40000tq4znuptne60');
